<title>USA: Digital launches HiNote notebook family.</title>
<headline>Digital launches HiNote notebook family.</headline>
<dateline>MAYNARD, Mass. 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Digital Equipment Corp said Monday it launches the Digital HiNote VP 500, a line of 120- or 133-megahertz Pentium-based notebook computers.</p>
<p>The company said the HiNote VP 500 is targeted at mobile professionals in small- to large-sized businesses. The new models are available immediately through Digital's channel partners, including authorized resellers and select retail outlets.</p>
<p>Estimated prices range from $2,499 to $3,699, the company said.</p>
